<title>GERMANY: Bayer H1 gp net profit 1.7 bln,up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Bayer H1 gp net profit 1.7 bln,up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1,700   up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     2,800   up 2.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   3,000   up 6 pct</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    3,200   up 18 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  27,400  up 11 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical and pharmaceuticals group is Bayer AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
